      <file role="modify">src/solutions/SpaarkeCore/entities/sprk_externalrecordaccess/entity-schema.md</file>
      <file role="new">an endpoint returning the caller's rights on one record (place it beside the external-access routes; name it in Step 1 after reading ExternalAccessEndpoints.cs)</file>
